Authorization 🔑

Definition:
Authorization means deciding what an authenticated user is allowed to do.

It answers the question:

What are you allowed to access?

Example

Admin

✅ View users

✅ Delete users

✅ Edit settings

Customer

✅ View profile

✅ Update profile

❌ Delete users

Real-life Example

In a bank:

Customer → Can view only their own account.
Bank Manager → Can view all customer accounts.
One-Line Answer

Authorization determines the permissions and resources an authenticated user is allowed to access.

